です。キャラクター2は特殊な身分（殺し屋）であるため、いつも傷だらけで帰宅し、キャラクター1に治療してもらっています。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1rcdOhdrgb9Oq2U4Q--sYDWbgJx4Xc8ba?usp=sharing\n\n以上、完成度については気にせず自由に描いてください。画像は個人的な鑑賞用です。金額が足りない場合はお知らせください。再依頼いたします。もしこの手のキャラクターが苦手であれば、お断りいただいても構いません！どうぞよろしくお願いいたします！", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 213957, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "鈍挫", "screen_name": "gyosonnotamiyo", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1581370223281963014/5nSMrHOJ.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1187287187928178688/1650779742/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 2, "complete_expiration_days": 30, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "banned": false, "nc": 176}, {"id": 2863593, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": false, "name": "客朧 ふみのり", "screen_name": "Minamade1una", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1983866609094815747/I38IliLO.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1114458074360598529/1761825528/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "none", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 90, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "banned": false, "nc": 49}, {"id": 3305074, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "𝐔𝐌𝐈𝐒𝐈𝐃𝐀", "screen_name": "umisida", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1762638987381145600/jrKFQS89.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1711192603604262912/1719659336/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester